m_assets/steam/apps/1162430/extras/62bea5009e846edbab274d6a2c0026ba.mp4?t=1753381303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The devs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Resni is the creator of the unofficial cult-classic &quot;Mibibli's Quest&quot;, and jars received their MFA and likes puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>We are also queer furries and a couple. Salad Fields might seem very silly (and it is) but we feel it reflects our truths as strange misfits in various ways. We hope that you find something in it you resonate with. :3</i></p>",
